---
title: Catalog search index maintenance
---
sequenceDiagram
	participant Admin as Catalog administrator
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant DB as Catalog database
	participant Scheduler
	participant Kafka
	participant Ingestion as Catalog Ingestion
	participant Embeddings as Embedding service
	participant Qdrant as Vector index

	Admin ->> Catalog: Create, update, or delete book
	Catalog ->> DB: Commit catalog change
	DB ->> DB: Trigger queues affected book revision
	Note over DB: Durable work, coalesced by book ID

	loop Every five minutes
		Scheduler ->> Kafka: Publish ProcessVectorBatchIntegrationEvent
		Kafka ->> Ingestion: KafkaTrigger (scheduler.process-vector-batch)
		Ingestion ->> DB: Acquire advisory lock and read up to 200 updates

		alt Lock busy or queue empty
			Note over Ingestion,DB: No batch work processed
		else Batch available
			loop Each queued book revision
				Ingestion ->> DB: Read current book content

				alt Active book
					Ingestion ->> Embeddings: Generate searchable vector
					Embeddings -->> Ingestion: Embedding
					Ingestion ->> Qdrant: Upsert searchable record
				else Missing or soft-deleted book
					Ingestion ->> Qdrant: Remove vector record
				end

				alt Vector operation succeeds
					Ingestion ->> DB: Acknowledge only if revision still matches
					Note over Ingestion,DB: A newer revision stays queued
				else Processing fails
					Ingestion ->> DB: Leave affected work unacknowledged
					Ingestion ->> DB: Release advisory lock
					Note over Ingestion,DB: Batch aborted, work remains queued for retry
				end
			end
			Ingestion ->> DB: Release advisory lock
		end
	end
